der-sold-his-company-for-a-reported-3-5-million-in-1906-and-built-an-orcas-island-estate-15-years-later-he-donated-more-than-2700-acres-to-washington-to-create-moran-state-park/articleshow/134487652.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/a-seattle-shipbuilder-sold-his-company-for-a-reported-3-5-million-in-1906-and-built-an-orcas-island-estate-15-years-later-he-donated-more-than-2700-acres-to-washington-to-create-moran-state-park/articleshow/134487652.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-25T22:03:55+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134489482,imgsize-897243.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Singapore welcomes Southeast Asia’s first okapi calf: Why this rare ‘forest giraffe’ is so unusual]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134489107.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/singapore-welcomes-southeast-asias-first-okapi-calf-why-this-rare-forest-giraffe-is-so-unusual/articleshow/134489107.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/singapore-welcomes-southeast-asias-first-okapi-calf-why-this-rare-forest-giraffe-is-so-unusual/articleshow/134489107.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-25T21:31:53+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134489130,imgsize-135196.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[America laughs as Trump pivots from 'Kung Flu' to hug Xi’s panda diplomacy]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134488753.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><lin